 * bl-recent-files-pipemenu:
  * lua-posix 34.0 removed the binding of posix.getopt to getopt_long
    in favour of supporting only the POSIX short options API. This is
    fine on Debian Stretch (lua-posix=31) but needs to be fixed for
    newer releases and portability to other distros.
  * Provisionally worked around in 2025-07-31 by disabling the long options.
    This means that genman.sh needs a special argument to pass the short -h
    in order to generate a manpage. (See genman.sh --help)
